  "instructions": [
    "season the cod fillets with fish seasoning blend, salt, and pepper",
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat",
    "sear the cod fillets for 2-3 minutes on each side, then remove from heat",
    "reduce heat to medium and add the chopped onion, cooking until translucent",
    "add the chopped garlic, ground cumin, and ground coriander, cooking for 1 minute",
    "add the lemon juice and stir to combine",
    "return the cod fillets to the skillet and simmer for 5-7 minutes, or until cooked through",
    "garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve"
